+# Accounts
+
+This context manages customer accounts, their lifecycle, and staff-only operational records.
+
+## Account lifecycle
+
+**Open**:
+An account available for normal operation.
+
+**Frozen**:
+An account temporarily blocked while staff investigate suspected misuse.
+
+**Closed**:
+An account that has been permanently ended and cannot be reopened by the freeze workflow.
+
+## Staff records
+
+**Internal note**:
+A staff-only account record used to preserve operational context and audit actions; customers cannot see it.
