+# Account freezes are audited with internal notes
+
+Freezing and unfreezing are staff-only lifecycle transitions between `OPEN` and `FROZEN`; each successful transition writes an internal account note authored by the acting staff user, with the freeze reason included in the note. Closed accounts remain outside this workflow so their terminal state is not silently reopened or changed.
